      "body_html": "<p><strong>30 Smart Inch Combination Wall Oven with Smartthinq® Technology</strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><br><span>LG presents the 30\" Combination wall oven, marrying the speed and convenience of a microwave speed oven with the precision and versatility of a convection oven. The units offer over 2 dozen cooking options between them, and is ready to tackle any task. Control all tasks with a the sleek and easy to use SmoothTouch™ glass panel controls. The WideView™ Window provides a complete view of whatever you have in the oven, and paired with halogen interior lighting makes it easy to keep an eye on your dish(es).</span></p>",
