      "title": "BRAND NEW LG  (LDFC2423V)\n24 Inch Full Console Dishwasher with 15 Place Settings, 52 dBA, 5 Wash Cycles, Nylon Coated Racks, Dynamic Dry™, and ENERGY STAR® Qualified: Stainless Steel Look",
      "handle": "brand-new-lg-ldfc2423v-24-inch-full-console-dishwasher-with-15-place-settings-52-dba-5-wash-cycles-nylon-coated-racks-dynamic-dry™-and-energy-star®-qualified-stainless-steel-look",
      "body_html": "<h2 class=\"border-bottom mt2\">Description</h2>\n<div class=\"mb2\"><strong>24 Inch Full Console Dishwasher with 15 Place Setting Capacity</strong></div>\n<div class=\"mb2\">\n<br>Make cleanup easy with this spacious dishwasher. Fit all the plates, bowls, and stemware in with space for up to 15 place settings of dishes. Enjoy powerful cleaning and leave nothing behind with SenseClean™ Wash System, Dynamic Dry, 5-wash cycles, 6-options, and 3-spray arms. It also includes LG's EasyRack™ Plus system allowing you to change the racks around easily to fit any load. Finally, there's a dishwasher that gets the job done.</div>",
